ESP32-CAM Discord Bot - Privacy Policy

This bot is a private project used to request image captures from an ESP32-CAM device.

Data collected:
- The bot reads Discord messages only to detect the CAPTURE command.
- The bot may use the Discord user ID of the person who sends the command for permission checks.
- The bot does not store messages, photos, usernames, or user data in a database.

Images:
- When CAPTURE is used, the bot requests an image from the ESP32-CAM and sends it to the Discord channel.
- The bot does not permanently store the captured image.

Data sharing:
- Captured images are sent only to the Discord channel where the command is used.
- No data is sold or shared with third parties.

Contact:
For questions or data removal requests, contact joao2000maia@gmail.com.
